   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The particle -pun",
     "texto": [
      "**Pun** is written separately and usually means \"also\" or \"even\": **Warga pun mengungsi** («The residents also took refuge»). Don't confuse it with compound words written together, such as **meskipun**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The clitic -nya",
     "texto": [
      "**-nya** attaches to the word before it. It can show possession or refer back to something already mentioned: **penyebabnya** («its cause»), **dampaknya** («its impact»). The form depends on the context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
